\subsection{Combined hs4 + hs6 lines}{

Some headings (e.g. \verb{15.03  1503.00  Lard stearin...}) place both the hs4
heading code and the hs6 code on the same line. In this case the description
is used for both \code{hs4_desc} and \code{hs6_desc}, and \code{hs5_desc} is \code{NA}.
